<title>USA: Lechters Inc Jan same store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Lechters Inc Jan same store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISON, N.J. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$26.7	$32.7    - 18.1     - 19.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $441.2     $432.1     + 2.1	- 1.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended  Feb. 1, 1997.</p>
<p>1996 month represents five weeks.</p>
<p>1996 year represents 53 weeks.</p>
<p>Same store sales for the four week period increased 5.0 percent if the 1996 period was compared to a four week period in 1995.</p>
</text>
